Footloose is a drama, music, romance film directed by Craig Brewer.

3
00:17:50,526 --> 00:17:56,526
Ren MacCormack is transplanted from Boston to the small southern town
of Bomont where loud music and dancing are prohibited.

4
00:23:47,368 --> 00:23:53,368
Not one to bow to the status quo, Ren challenges the ban, revitalizing the town and
falling in love with the minister’s troubled daughter Ariel in the process.

