01:05:25,263 --> 01:05:31,263
Footloose is a 2011 American musical drama film directed by Craig
Brewer, who co-wrote the screenplay with Dean Pitchford.

12
01:11:22,105 --> 01:11:28,105
A remake of the 1984 film, the film stars Kenny Wormald,
Julianne Hough, Andie MacDowell, and Dennis Quaid.

13
01:17:18,947 --> 01:17:24,947
The film follows a young man who moves from Boston to a small
Southern town and protests the town's ban against dancing.

14
01:23:15,789 --> 01:23:21,789
Filming took place from September to November 2010 in Georgia.

15
01:29:12,631 --> 01:29:18,631
The film was released in Australia and New Zealand on October 6, 2011, and
in North America on October 14, 2011 by Paramount Pictures.

16
01:35:09,473 --> 01:35:15,473
The film received mixed reviews and grossed $15.5 million in
its opening weekend and $63 million worldwide.

17
01:41:06,315 --> 01:41:12,315
The film explores themes of dancing, dance, dancer, remake, prom.

18
01:47:03,157 --> 01:47:09,157
The tone is emotional.
